{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791627100252,"sessionID":"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_03_DfL5drn5u5ioz0jdZmkn2017","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"tt-assessment|api-brief"},"output":"Found 13 matches\n/workspace/docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/session.log:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791627089438,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_00_G5PXUh3a7kVwWHBweF5E6362\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/brief.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/brief.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Brief: time tracking improvements\\n2: \\n3: type: feature\\n4: id: joke\\n5: branch: feature/joke_time-tracking-improvements\\n6: date: 2026-10-10\\n7: author: Leander Muskalla\\n8: \\n9: ## What\\n10: \\n11: Rework time tracking so its UI stops hiding, duplicating, and contradicting the\\n12: data model it already has. The domain model is sound (projects own many\\n13: categories; a single running timer derived from entries), and the store/contract\\n14: layer plus `ActiveTimer` are solid — keep them. This job addresses the full set\\n15: of findings in `docs/tt-assessment.md` (its §6 table is the line-level\\n16: authority): navigation and information architecture, the create/edit flows,\\n17: dashboard and statistics composition, and visual/accessibility/i18n consistency.\\n18: The assessment changed no source; this is the follow-up implementation.\\n19: \\n20: Notable changes, grouped as workstreams:\\n21: \\n22: - **URL-driven navigation.** Move the Dashboard/Entries view (and ideally the\\n23:   selected project) into the route or a search param so reload, deep-linking, and\\n24:   back/forward restore the view; derive the active tab from the URL instead of\\n25:   store state. Replace the sidebar's inline `display` toggle with the app's\\n26:   `open`-state + transition drawer pattern used by todos/notes.\\n27: - **Discoverable management.** Stop hiding project/category actions behind hover\\n28:   and double-click; give icon-only buttons accessible names and make the same\\n29:   actions reachable by touch and keyboard.\\n30: - **Single source of truth for durations and colours.** Consum...\n  Line 10: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791627091858,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_03_oBYe2260MFAIzWXUVxzD2268\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/session.log\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/session.log</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: === 2026-10-10T12:11:25+02:00 analyst (attempt 1) ===\\n2: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_start\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1791627088973,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_1254bd44c001cvSZFod5pa0tcl\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_1254bcca1001XWuNsdn6hSEYeN\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}}\\n3: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1791627089438,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"call_00_G5PXUh3a7kVwWHBweF5E6362\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"/workspace/docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/brief.md\\\"},\\\"output\\\":\\\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/brief.md</path>\\\\n<type>file</type>\\\\n<content>\\\\n1: # Brief: time tracking improvements\\\\n2: \\\\n3: type: feature\\\\n4: id: joke\\\\n5: branch: feature/joke_time-tracking-improvements\\\\n6: date: 2026-10-10\\\\n7: author: Leander Muskalla\\\\n8: \\\\n9: ## What\\\\n10: \\\\n11: Rework time tracking so its UI stops hiding, duplicating, and contradicting the\\\\n12: data model it already has. The domain model is sound (projects own many\\\\n13: categories; a single running timer derived from entries), and the store/contract\\\\n14: layer plus `ActiveTimer` are solid — keep them. This job addresses the full set\\\\n15: of findings in `docs/tt-assessment.md` (its §6 table is the line-level\\\\n16: authority): navigation and information architecture, the create/edit flows,\\\\n17: dashboard and statistics composition, and visual/accessibility/i18n consistenc...\n  Line 13: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791627093588,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_00_G0H2fNXIB8UyQ6bfF3BJ6083\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"error\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/tt-assessment.md\"},\"error\":\"File not found: /workspace/docs/tt-assessment.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1791627093576,\"end\":1791627093585}},\"id\":\"prt_1254be5fe001fQpX685CD4L1dV\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1254bdf9b001dE39cmxMY8Le2n\"}}\n\n  Line 17: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791627095835,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_00_B7q1kQlS5wjWMBZk3aGD0635\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"**/tt-assessment.md\"},\"output\":\"No files found\",\"metadata\":{\"count\":0,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"\",\"time\":{\"start\":1791627095828,\"end\":1791627095834}},\"id\":\"prt_1254beee8001wtbKysvhSAQCG1\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1254be8e4001ryPV4l1DCg7B34\"}}\n\n  Line 18: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791627095913,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_01_2sXT6ojXZntNMksbkYVt5834\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"**/api-brief.md\"},\"output\":\"No files found\",\"metadata\":{\"count\":0,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"\",\"time\":{\"start\":1791627095900,\"end\":1791627095912}},\"id\":\"prt_1254bef270016gMTgfPHNpmbS3\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1254be8e4001ryPV4l1DCg7B34\"}}\n\n\n/workspace/docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/brief.md:\n  Line 15: of findings in `docs/tt-assessment.md` (its §6 table is the line-level\n\n  Line 34:   (added per `api-brief.md`), never from its first category; replace the\n\n  Line 40:   added per `api-brief.md`) and rely on the clarified anchor rule for\n\n  Line 42:   their project, per `api-brief.md`) and drop the `uncategorized` fallback in\n\n  Line 54:   `api-brief.md`) so it filters entries by category rather than silently\n\n  Line 76:   job needs are tracked in `api-brief.md` and are assumed to land: an editable\n\n  Line 98: - The API changes in `api-brief.md` are assumed to be fulfilled alongside this\n\n  Line 105: - Every claim in `docs/tt-assessment.md` is already verified to `file:line`; use\n","metadata":{"matches":13,"truncated":false},"title":"tt-assessment|api-brief","time":{"start":1791627100241,"end":1791627100251}},"id":"prt_1254c0031001FfNTLCSDZMtXB9","sessionID":"ses_edab4348cffevuzlKCe1ty7344","messageID":"msg_1254bf64a0019HTRnFmnhQNoBr"}}
