{"type":"text","timestamp":1791628345821,"sessionID":"ses_edab29d7fffe7q7IOFDa3tpcmo","part":{"id":"prt_1255ef750001kv0AXsY7k9msZZ","messageID":"msg_1255ee2a6001GBAbWWLP8nariB","sessionID":"ses_edab29d7fffe7q7IOFDa3tpcmo","type":"text","text":"All 18 tasks are implemented, committed, and the worktree is clean. Here's the summary:\n\n## What I did\n\nWorked through `tasks.md` task-by-task on `feature/joke_time-tracking-improvements`, committing each, with `npm run check` green at every step and `npm test` at the end (734/735 passing).\n\n**Foundation**\n- **TASK-1** contract mirror: optional project `color`, optional `has_exact_times` on update, and a statistics category-filter param.\n- **TASK-2** view is now URL-driven (`?tab=dashboard|entries|statistics`); removed store `activeTab`.\n- **TASK-3** mobile drawer rewritten to the app's `open`+`transition:fly` pattern.\n\n**Single source of truth**\n- **TASK-4** new unit-tested `TimeTrackingGroupingService` (project colour, no `uncategorized`), used by both breakdown surfaces; **TASK-5** consumes `project.total_duration`.\n\n**CRUD**\n- **TASK-6/7/8** merged `EntryCreate`/`EntryEdit` into one component: consistent ISO timestamps, `has_exact_times` on create+update, duration-only entries anchored to local noon of the chosen day (never rolling back), date hidden under exact times, no `projects[0]` default.\n- **TASK-9** entries editable from dashboard recent entries and project detail.\n\n**Dashboard/statistics**\n- **TASK-10** statistics moved to its own tab; **TASK-11** Pomodoro removed from the dashboard; **TASK-12** server-side category filter, local default range, project colour, shared duration format.\n\n**Polish**\n- **TASK-13** confirmed deletes everywhere; **TASK-14** discoverable/accessible controls; **TASK-15** shared form controls + validation feedback; **TASK-16** theme colours + contrast guard; **TASK-17** removed dead i18n keys; **TASK-18** shared `Heading`.\n\n## Decisions I had to make (documented in `implementation.md`)\n\n- `api-brief.md`/`tt-assessment.md` were not where the brief said (`tt-assessment.md` lives in the archive). I mirrored the assumed contract from the brief's own wording; the only invented name is the statistics param, `category_ids`.\n- `total_duration` assumed to be **minutes**.\n- **Pomodoro**: chose the brief's \"move out\" option (analyst-recommended); the component is left unreferenced pending a product decision.\n- **TASK-17**: only 3 of the 6 listed keys were still unused — `add_category`/`edit_category`/`color` are now wired up by TASK-14, and the `welcome_tour.steps.timeTracking` tips are actually consumed by `WelcomeTour.svelte` (the task's \"`dev.features.timeTracking`\" doesn't exist), so those were kept.\n\n## Caveats\n- The repo's `npm run lint` (prettier) already fails across ~450 untouched files, and one unrelated component test (`StatisticWidget` colour classes) fails at baseline — both pre-existing.\n- `node_modules` was missing; I ran `npm ci` to restore the pinned deps so the project's own `check`/`test` could run. No dependencies were added or changed.","time":{"start":1791628343120,"end":1791628345819}}}
