orized (it uses a separate `LinkLibrary` instance whose `activeFilter` is never set, so a store-method approach leaves it untouched). I also noted mobile has no category UI (`CategoryHeader` is `max-md:hidden`), so it's out o...\n  Line 70: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791376207226,\"sessionID\":\"ses_ee9a86284ffedma3YbQXzblH8I\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_02_G7flfiaq5bsH7hXP04LE0301\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/workspace/docs/jobs/punishment_link-library-with-a-category-selected-add-to-that-category/tasks.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/punishment_link-library-with-a-category-selected-add-to-that-category/tasks.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # Tasks: link library: with a category selected add to that category\\n2: \\n3: id: punishment\\n4: status: open\\n5: analyst: deepseek-v4-flash (analyst)\\n6: date: 2026-10-07\\n7: \\n8: <!-- Produced by @analyst from brief.md. -->\\n9: \\n10: ## Context / findings\\n11: \\n12: The bug is a hardcoded value, not a missing feature.\\n13: \\n14: - `src/lib/components/libraries/links/LinkCreate.svelte` builds the create\\n15:   request in `onsubmit()` and always sends `category_id: null` (line 44),\\n16:   regardless of which category the user is currently viewing.\\n17: - The current selection lives in `LinkLibrary.activeFilter`\\n18:   (`src/lib/state/LinkLibrary.svelte.ts` line 35), typed\\n19:   `null | number | 'favorite'`:\\n20:   - `null` = \\\"All\\\" tab (CategoryHeader line 17)\\n21:   - `0`    = \\\"Uncategorized\\\" tab (line 56)\\n22:   - positive number = a real category id (line 85)\\n23:   - `'favorite'` = favourites tab (line 30)\\n24: - `LinkLibrary.create()` calls `load()`, which calls `reapplyFilter()`, so once\\n25:   the new link is saved under the selected category it will already appear in\\n26:   the current view — no extra refresh logic is needed.\\n27: - Existing precedent for \\\"inherit the a