68}}\n869: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1791628340029,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab29d7fffe7q7IOFDa3tpcmo\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1255eeb3c001uVLcfuZaMZ8FQz\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1255ee2a6001GBAbWWLP8nariB\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab29d7fffe7q7IOFDa3tpcmo\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n870: {\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1791628345821,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab29d7fffe7q7IOFDa3tpcmo\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1255ef750001kv0AXsY7k9msZZ\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1255ee2a6001GBAbWWLP8nariB\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab29d7fffe7q7IOFDa3tpcmo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"All 18 tasks are implemented, committed, and the worktree is clean. Here's the summary:\\n\\n## What I did\\n\\nWorked through `tasks.md` task-by-task on `feature/joke_time-tracking-improvements`, committing each, with `npm run check` green at every step and `npm test` at the end (734/735 passing).\\n\\n**Foundation**\\n- **TASK-1** contract mirror: optional project `color`, optional `has_exact_times` on update, and a statistics category-filter param.\\n- **TASK-2** view is now URL-driven (`?tab=dashboard|entries|statistics`); removed store `activeTab`.\\n- **TASK-3** mobile drawer rewritten to the app's `open`+`transition:fly` pattern.\\n\\n**Single source of truth**\\n- **TASK-4** new unit-tested `TimeTrackingGroupingService` (project colour, no `uncategorized`), used by both breakdown surfaces; **TASK-5** consumes `project.total_duration`.\\n\\n**CRUD**\\n- **TASK-6/7/8** merged `EntryCreate`/`EntryEdit` into one component: consistent ISO timestamps, `has_exact_times` on create+update, duration-only entries anchored to local noon of the chosen day (never rolling back), date hidden under exact times, no `projects[0]` default.\\n- **TASK-9** entries editable from dashboard recent entries and project detail.\\n\\n**Dashboard/statistics**\\n- **TASK-10** statistics moved to its own tab; **TASK-11** Pomodoro removed from the dashboard; **TASK-12** server-side category filter, local default range, project colour, shared duration format.\\n\\n**Polish**\\n- **TASK-13** confirmed deletes everywhere; **TASK-14** discoverable/accessible controls; **TASK-15** shared form controls + validation feedback; **TASK-16** theme colours + contrast guard; **TASK-17** removed dead i18n keys; **TASK-18** shared `Heading`.\\n\\n## Decisions I had to make (documented in `... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n\n(Showing lines 840-870 of 1017. Use offset=871 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1791628279802,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edab29d7fffe7q7IOFDa3tpcmo\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"bash\",\"callID\":\"call_00_pSRM9HwhjgZw5eXZZxQq2124\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cd /workspace && git diff --name-only 9baff06..HEAD | tr '\\\\n' ' '; echo; echo \\\"=== prettier check on new files ===\\\"; npx prettier --check src/lib/services/TimeTrackingGroupingService.ts src/lib/components/time-tracking/EntryCreate.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte 2>&1 | tail\"},\"output\":\"docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/session.log docs/jobs/joke_time-tracking-improvements/tokens.json src/lib/components/dashboard/widgets/TimeTrackingWidget.svelte src/lib/components/forms/NumberInput.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/DashboardView.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/Entry.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/EntryCreate.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/EntryEdit.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/GroupedEntries.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/ProjectCreate.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/StatisticsView.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/TimeBreakdownWidget.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/TimeTrackingNavigation.svelte src/lib/components/time-tracking/TimerWidget.svelte src/lib/components/ui/buttons/InlineDeleteButton.svelte src/lib/components/ui/buttons/InlineEditButton.svelte src/lib/helpers/ColorHelper.ts src/lib